      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -504,
        -280
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Multi-channel support router\n\n**Reference architecture.**\n\nEmail, web chat and WhatsApp messages are normalised into one ticket shape. A classifier sorts each ticket: urgent, how-to, billing or other.\n\nHow-to questions go to an agent that answers from the help centre — but only a confident answer is sent. Everything else lands with the right team in Slack.\n\nEvery ticket is logged with its SLA clock, and a scheduled check escalates anything about to breach.",
        "width": 420,
        "height": 560,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
